{"id": "FC-29bad80f33eeb126", "stem": "2.已知f(x)=2^(x)+x，则“f(x_(1))=f(x_(2))”是“x_(1)=x_(2)”的(　　)", "options": {"A": "充分不必要条件", "B": "必要不充分条件", "C": "充要条件", "D": "既不充分也不必要条件"}, "answer": "C", "explanation": "因为函数y=2^(x)，y=x在R上为增函数，\n则函数f(x)=2^(x)+x在R上为增函数，\n则“f(x_(1))=f(x_(2))”可以推出“x_(1)=x_(2)”，“x_(1)=x_(2)”也可推出“f(x_(1))=f(x_(2))”，\n故“f(x_(1))=f(x_(2))”是“x_(1)=x_(2)”的充要条件.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K009"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K009"], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值.docx", "source_section": "§2.2　函数的单调性与最值", "source_question_number": "2.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 227–236", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度和预计用时为规则草标，需教师核对；未批准。", "利用严格递增与一一对应判定条件关系。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核，确认题干、公式、选项、答案、解析及分类可接受。"], "fingerprint": "331fd2342c2c619e046822c8c99713f1793f6e48ee3444e6349e9b858437e4e7", "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "question_type": "single_choice", "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-05T14:36:46.659597+00:00", "review_decision": "approve", "candidate_snapshot_sha256": "cbccf1d5b5663852a09e25ba15749796c4e6283acf26cc247487755549bddad6", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true, "checklist": ["答案是否正确", "解析是否推出答案", "选项是否唯一", "是否存在定义域遗漏", "是否存在参数边界遗漏", "difficulty 是否合理", "primary 知识点是否正确"], "basis": "explicit_user_attestation"}}
{"id": "FC-cdd302d9307a31d6", "stem": "13.(2026·昆明模拟)已知函数f(x)=log_((1)/(3))|x+(a)/(x)−4|(a≥0)在(4，+∞)上单调递减，则实数a的取值范围是 (　　)", "options": {"A": "[4，+∞)", "B": "(0，4]", "C": "[0，16]", "D": "[16，+∞)"}, "answer": "C", "explanation": "令t=|x+(a)/(x)−4|，因为y=log_((1)/(3))t为减函数，f(x)=log_((1)/(3))|x+(a)/(x)−4|在(4，+∞)上单调递减，\n所以t=|x+(a)/(x)−4|在(4，+∞)上单调递增.\n令g(x)=x+(a)/(x)-4，\n当a>0时，g(x)=x+(a)/(x)-4在(sqrt(a)，+∞)上单调递增，g(4)=4+(a)/(4)-4=(a)/(4)>0，\n所以当sqrt(a)≤4时满足t=|x+(a)/(x)−4|在(4，+∞)上单调递增，即得0<a≤16；\n当a=0时，t=|x-4|在(4，+∞)上单调递增，当x>4时，t=x-4>0，满足题意.\n综上可得0≤a≤16.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K003", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K010"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K010"], "difficulty": 4, "ability_tags": ["logical_reasoning", "parameter_analysis", "classification_discussion"], "method_tags": ["monotonicity", "substitution"], "estimated_time": 240, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.2　函数的单调性与最值.docx", "source_section": "§2.2　函数的单调性与最值", "source_question_number": "13.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 346–356", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度和预计用时为规则草标，需教师核对；未批准。", "复合单调性、绝对值与参数零值边界讨论。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核，确认题干、公式、选项、答案、解析及分类可接受。"], "fingerprint": "b85d74dc7ac8a6439953ca7156557b8412e677f742a31748091ef3146651a2bd", "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "question_type": "single_choice", "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-05T14:36:46.659933+00:00", "review_decision": "approve", "candidate_snapshot_sha256": "cbccf1d5b5663852a09e25ba15749796c4e6283acf26cc247487755549bddad6", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true, "checklist": ["答案是否正确", "解析是否推出答案", "选项是否唯一", "是否存在定义域遗漏", "是否存在参数边界遗漏", "difficulty 是否合理", "primary 知识点是否正确"], "basis": "explicit_user_attestation"}}
{"id": "FC-05bd059ae11f5e23", "stem": "1.(2025·北京模拟)下列函数中，既是奇函数又在区间(-∞，+∞)上单调递增的是(　　)", "options": {"A": "f(x)=-x^(3)", "B": "f(x)=2^(x)", "C": "f(x)=e^(x)-e^(-x)", "D": "f(x)=lg x"}, "answer": "C", "explanation": "对于A，显然函数f(x)=-x^(3)为奇函数，且在(-∞，+∞)上单调递减，故A不符合题意；\n对于B，f(-x)=2^(-x)，显然函数f(x)是非奇非偶函数，故B不符合题意；\n对于C，由函数f(x)=e^(x)-e^(-x)的定义域为R，f(-x)=e^(-x)-e^(x)=-f(x)，则函数f(x)是奇函数，由函数y=e^(x)在R上单调递增，函数y=-e^(-x)在R上单调递增，则函数f(x)在R上单调递增，故C符合题意；\n对于D，由函数f(x)=lg x的定义域为(0，+∞)，则函数f(x)是非奇非偶函数，故D不符合题意.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K003", "K008", "K009", "K010"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K003", "K008", "K009", "K010"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["concept_understanding", "logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["definition", "monotonicity"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性.docx", "source_section": "§2.3　函数的奇偶性", "source_question_number": "1.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 209–216", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度和预计用时为规则草标，需教师核对；未批准。", "综合奇函数定义与单调性，保留奇偶性为主目标。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核，确认题干、公式、选项、答案、解析及分类可接受。"], "fingerprint": "b4c117cdac57ccdabcc662a29595c41e4955f93449808d9fc7bd410414f054ba", "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "question_type": "single_choice", "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-05T14:36:46.660241+00:00", "review_decision": "approve", "candidate_snapshot_sha256": "cbccf1d5b5663852a09e25ba15749796c4e6283acf26cc247487755549bddad6", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true, "checklist": ["答案是否正确", "解析是否推出答案", "选项是否唯一", "是否存在定义域遗漏", "是否存在参数边界遗漏", "difficulty 是否合理", "primary 知识点是否正确"], "basis": "explicit_user_attestation"}}
{"id": "FC-c1b7d691e507d604", "stem": "3.(2025·赤峰模拟)若函数f(x)=a-(3)/(3^(x)+1)是奇函数，则实数a的值为(　　)", "options": {"A": "(1)/(2)", "B": "1", "C": "(3)/(2)", "D": "3"}, "answer": "C", "explanation": "因为函数f(x)=a-(3)/(3^(x)+1)是奇函数，定义域为R，\n所以f(0)=a-(3)/(3^(0)+1)=a-(3)/(2)=0，解得a=(3)/(2)，\n当a=(3)/(2)时，f(x)=(3)/(2)-(3)/(3^(x)+1)=(3·3^(x)−3)/(2(3^(x)+1))，\nf(-x)=(3·3^(−x)−3)/(2(3^(−x)+1))=(3−3·3^(x))/(2(1+3^(x)))=-f(x)，\n所以函数f(x)=(3)/(2)-(3)/(3^(x)+1)是奇函数，则a=(3)/(2).", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K009"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K009"], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["parameter_analysis", "calculation", "logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["special_value", "definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性.docx", "source_section": "§2.3　函数的奇偶性", "source_question_number": "3.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 229–236", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度和预计用时为规则草标，需教师核对；未批准。", "先由f(0)=0求参数，再检验奇函数定义。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核，确认题干、公式、选项、答案、解析及分类可接受。"], "fingerprint": "12aac4cdd329de7a3d24746d933716be4550228b294fbca7c78d89a3f2ca44ed", "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "question_type": "single_choice", "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-05T14:36:46.660526+00:00", "review_decision": "approve", "candidate_snapshot_sha256": "cbccf1d5b5663852a09e25ba15749796c4e6283acf26cc247487755549bddad6", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true, "checklist": ["答案是否正确", "解析是否推出答案", "选项是否唯一", "是否存在定义域遗漏", "是否存在参数边界遗漏", "difficulty 是否合理", "primary 知识点是否正确"], "basis": "explicit_user_attestation"}}
{"id": "FC-43ce16538e8a3d52", "stem": "5.(2021·全国乙卷)设函数f(x)=(1−x)/(1+x)，则下列函数中为奇函数的是(　　)", "options": {"A": "f(x-1)-1", "B": "f(x-1)+1", "C": "f(x+1)-1", "D": "f(x+1)+1"}, "answer": "B", "explanation": "方法一　因为f(x)=(1−x)/(1+x)，所以f(x-1)=(1−(x−1))/(1+(x−1))=(2−x)/(x)，f(x+1)=(1−(x+1))/(1+(x+1))=(−x)/(x+2).\n对于A，令F(x)=f(x-1)-1=(2−x)/(x)-1=(2−2x)/(x)，定义域关于原点对称，但不满足F(x)=-F(-x)，即f(x-1)-1不是奇函数；\n对于B，令G(x)=f(x-1)+1=(2−x)/(x)+1=(2)/(x)，定义域关于原点对称，且满足G(x)=-G(-x)，即f(x-1)+1是奇函数；\n对于C，f(x+1)-1=(−x)/(x+2)-1=(−x−x−2)/(x+2)=-(2x+2)/(x+2)，定义域不关于原点对称，即f(x+1)-1为非奇非偶函数；\n对于D，f(x+1)+1=(−x)/(x+2)+1=(−x+x+2)/(x+2)=(2)/(x+2)，定义域不关于原点对称，即f(x+1)+1为非奇非偶函数.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K005", "related_knowledge_point_ids": [], "question_prerequisite_ids": [], "difficulty": 3, "ability_tags": ["calculation", "logical_reasoning"], "method_tags": ["substitution", "definition"], "estimated_time": 180, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.3　函数的奇偶性.docx", "source_section": "§2.3　函数的奇偶性", "source_question_number": "5.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 243–251", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度和预计用时为规则草标，需教师核对；未批准。", "多个代换表达式，逐项检查定义域对称与奇性。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核，确认题干、公式、选项、答案、解析及分类可接受。"], "fingerprint": "43c86c7eb7b449e35cfb8d7fdafb35d2dbced61e2d0fffce7018b672922a51e5", "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "question_type": "single_choice", "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-05T14:36:46.660813+00:00", "review_decision": "approve", "candidate_snapshot_sha256": "cbccf1d5b5663852a09e25ba15749796c4e6283acf26cc247487755549bddad6", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true, "checklist": ["答案是否正确", "解析是否推出答案", "选项是否唯一", "是否存在定义域遗漏", "是否存在参数边界遗漏", "difficulty 是否合理", "primary 知识点是否正确"], "basis": "explicit_user_attestation"}}
