{"id": "FC-a138c98013d5870e", "stem": "1.(2026·北京朝阳区检测)为了得到函数y=ln(ex)的图象，只需把函数y=ln x图象上所有的点(　　)", "options": {"A": "向上平移1个单位长度", "B": "向下平移1个单位长度", "C": "向左平移e个单位长度", "D": "向右平移e个单位长度"}, "answer": "A", "explanation": "因为y=ln(ex)即为y=1+ln x，\n故只需把函数y=ln x图象上所有的点向上平移1个单位长度即可，故A正确，B错误；\n对于C，把函数y=ln x图象上所有的点向左平移e个单位长度后所得图象对应的解析式为y=ln(x+e)，故C错误；\n对于D，把函数y=ln x图象上所有的点向右平移e个单位长度后所得图象对应的解析式为y=ln(x-e)，故D错误.", "taxonomy_version": "function_v2", "primary_knowledge_point_id": "K012", "related_knowledge_point_ids": ["K010"], "question_prerequisite_ids": ["K010"], "difficulty": 2, "ability_tags": ["graph_analysis", "calculation"], "method_tags": ["graph_transform"], "estimated_time": 120, "source_type": "docx", "source_file": "data/raw_sources/function/第二章　§2.9　函数的图象.docx", "source_section": "§2.9　函数的图象", "source_question_number": "1.", "source_locator": "word/document.xml paragraphs 176–185", "extraction_status": "complete", "quality_status": "approved", "review_notes": ["知识点、难度和预计用时为规则草标，需教师核对；未批准。", "先化简ln(ex)=1+ln x，再判断平移方向。", "用户已基于可读版完成人工审核，确认题干、公式、选项、答案、解析及分类可接受。"], "fingerprint": "eb4c1b3982070ab7de41cf209751b725ba209b1cce7cdb495a0fa6cf0de33976", "version": 1, "extraction_warnings": [], "image_resources": [], "annotation_status": "confirmed", "question_type": "single_choice", "reviewed_by": "manual_user", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-05T14:36:46.664269+00:00", "review_decision": "approve", "candidate_snapshot_sha256": "cbccf1d5b5663852a09e25ba15749796c4e6283acf26cc247487755549bddad6", "review_confirmation": {"reviewer": "manual_user", "confirmed": true, "checklist": ["答案是否正确", "解析是否推出答案", "选项是否唯一", "是否存在定义域遗漏", "是否存在参数边界遗漏", "difficulty 是否合理", "primary 知识点是否正确"], "basis": "explicit_user_attestation"}}
